---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Club dashboard — Chess United"
  description="Private dashboard for Chess United club officers: verify membership and tournament GCash references, pack and ship orders, and approve partner club listings."
  noindex
  canonical={false}
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script is:inline src="/scripts/admin.js?v=gcash-checkout" defer></script>
    <script is:inline src="/scripts/admin-shipping.js?v=gcash-checkout" defer></script>
  </Fragment>

  <Header />

  <main id="main">
    <header class="page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">Club officers</p>
        <h1>Club dashboard.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Verify GCash reference numbers, pack and ship orders, and approve partner club listings.
          This page is private: it stays out of search engines and needs the club's admin token.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="queue-title">
      <div class="wrap">
        <noscript>
          <div class="note-box">
            <strong>JavaScript is off.</strong> The dashboard reads the club's queue through this
            page, so it needs JavaScript switched on. Nothing else on the site does.
          </div>
        </noscript>

        <div data-admin-signin hidden>
          <form class="form-card" data-admin-signin-form>
            <h2>Sign in</h2>
            <p class="lede">
              Enter the club's admin token. It is checked on the club's server, and the session it
              opens is held in a cookie this page's scripts cannot read.
            </p>

            <div class="form-grid form-grid--one">
              <div class="field">
                <label for="admin-token">Admin token</label>
                <input
                  id="admin-token"
                  name="token"
                  type="password"
                  required
                  autocomplete="current-password"
                />
              </div>
            </div>

            <p class="form-status" data-admin-status hidden></p>

            <div class="form-actions">
              <button class="btn" type="submit">
                <Icon name="check" size={16} /> Sign in
              </button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div data-admin-dashboard hidden>
          <div class="section-head">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Queue</p>
              <h2 id="queue-title">Waiting on the club.</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="lede">
              Every membership, tournament entry, order and partner club that needs a decision.
              Moving a record here is what the member or buyer sees next.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="form-actions">
            <button class="btn" type="button" data-admin-reload>
              <Icon name="download" size={16} /> Reload the queue
            </button>
            <button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-admin-signout>Sign out</button>
          </div>

          <p class="form-status" data-admin-panel-status hidden></p>

          <div class="note-box mt-3" aria-labelledby="sheets-title">
            <h3 id="sheets-title">Google Sheets</h3>
            <p>Officers can edit the <strong>paid</strong> dropdown directly in Sheets: Paid or Not paid. Select Sync now here to import the changes. Use filter views instead of moving or sorting rows.</p>
            <p data-sheets-status role="status">Checking spreadsheet sync…</p>
            <div class="form-actions">
              <button class="btn btn--sm btn--ghost" type="button" data-sheets-check>Check connection</button>
              <button class="btn btn--sm" type="button" data-sheets-sync>Sync now</button>
              <a class="text-link" href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1HyWudE1b-yizLdvrjAwUfx7roC-jLYQZig-VfpoCLbI/edit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open spreadsheet</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <details class="note-box mt-3" data-shipping-settings>
            <summary><strong>Delivery setup — dispatch locations and measured parcels</strong></summary>
            <p>Choose the actual dispatch location and enter each product’s packed weight in kg and length, width and height in cm. Each unit is quoted as a separate parcel using the courier’s public calculator, including valuation. Leave all four measurements empty to keep that product available for pickup only.</p>
            <p>Suggested dispatch location: San Fernando City, La Union. Confirm it before saving. LBC uses the smallest official package that fits the entered packed dimensions; leave enough weight allowance for its outer box. J&amp;T uses EZ parcel service.</p>
            <form data-shipping-settings-form>
              <div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="shipping-origin-jt">J&amp;T dispatch location</label><select id="shipping-origin-jt" data-shipping-origin="jt" required></select></div><div class="field"><label for="shipping-origin-lbc">LBC dispatch location</label><select id="shipping-origin-lbc" data-shipping-origin="lbc" required></select></div></div>
              <div class="table-wrap mt-2"><table><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Packed kg</th><th>Length cm</th><th>Width cm</th><th>Height cm</th></tr></thead><tbody data-shipping-products></tbody></table></div>
              <p data-shipping-settings-status role="status"></p><button type="submit" class="btn btn--sm">Save delivery setup</button>
            </form>
          </details>

          <div class="admin-grid mt-3" data-admin-stats></div>

          <div class="queue">
            <section aria-labelledby="q-members">
              <h3 id="q-members">Membership registrations</h3>
              <div class="table-wrap">
                <table>
                  <thead>
                    <tr>
                      <th scope="col">Member no.</th>
                      <th scope="col">Member</th>
                      <th scope="col">Division</th>
                      <th scope="col">Card</th>
                      <th scope="col">Status</th>
                      <th scope="col">Paid</th>
                      <th scope="col">Actions</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody data-queue-body="members"></tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="q-registrations">
              <h3 id="q-registrations">Tournament entries</h3>
              <div class="table-wrap">
                <table>
                  <thead>
                    <tr>
                      <th scope="col">Entry</th>
                      <th scope="col">Player</th>
                      <th scope="col">Division</th>
                      <th scope="col">GCash ref</th>
                      <th scope="col">Amount</th>
                      <th scope="col">Payment</th>
                      <th scope="col">Actions</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody data-queue-body="registrations"></tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="q-orders">
              <h3 id="q-orders">Merchandise orders</h3>
              <div class="table-wrap">
                <table>
                  <thead>
                    <tr>
                      <th scope="col">Order</th>
                      <th scope="col">Customer</th>
                      <th scope="col">Items</th>
                      <th scope="col">Delivery / pickup</th>
                      <th scope="col">Total</th>
                      <th scope="col">Payment</th>
                      <th scope="col">Fulfilment</th>
                      <th scope="col">Actions</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody data-queue-body="orders"></tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="q-clubs">
              <h3 id="q-clubs">Partner club submissions</h3>
              <div class="table-wrap">
                <table>
                  <thead>
                    <tr>
                      <th scope="col">Club</th>
                      <th scope="col">Where</th>
                      <th scope="col">Meets</th>
                      <th scope="col">Officer contact</th>
                      <th scope="col">Status</th>
                      <th scope="col">Actions</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody data-queue-body="clubs"></tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="q-events">
              <h3 id="q-events">Partner club tournament listings</h3>
              <div class="table-wrap">
                <table>
                  <thead>
                    <tr>
                      <th scope="col">Tournament</th>
                      <th scope="col">Club id</th>
                      <th scope="col">Date</th>
                      <th scope="col">Venue</th>
                      <th scope="col">Status</th>
                      <th scope="col">Actions</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody data-queue-body="events"></tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </section>
          </div>

          <div class="note-box mt-3">
            <strong>Printed membership IDs:</strong> a member who ticked the printed card has paid
            ₱200 by GCash. Match the reference number against the club account before the ID is
            printed, then hand the card and lanyard over at a Saturday session.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Base>
